/target
# Manuals, backups and harvested tables are third-party material: keep local, never commit.
/local
/dist
# Built tables (third-party data too) to carry to another machine: the
# install scripts fill it where local\ holds the tables and read it elsewhere.
/tsv
# The probe and harvest tools (and the e2e check built on them) stay on the
# machine they were made for; they build on their own, outside the workspace.
/probe
